  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the reason reported when a ranging session fails to open or is closed.</summary>
    <remarks>The values correspond to the reason constants in <see cref="T:Android.Ranging.RangingSession.ICallback" />. They distinguish local or remote requests, unsupported configurations, system policy, missing peers, and an unknown reason.</remarks>
  </Docs>
